[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18781.43, "timestamp": "05:13:01", "text": "可以把整个东西彻底摧毁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18784.31, "timestamp": "05:13:04", "text": "他们可以严厉打击这种行为。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18786.948, "timestamp": "05:13:06", "text": "想象一下人们只是瞎胡闹的样子"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18789.91, "timestamp": "05:13:09", "text": "突然间，PvP模式开始了，而且很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18792.708, "timestamp": "05:13:12", "text": "将会彻底失控。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18795.27, "timestamp": "05:13:15", "text": "那又会彻底毁了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18797.59, "timestamp": "05:13:17", "text": "一切都是因为根钦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18799.91, "timestamp": "05:13:19", "text": "游戏的目的就像是交朋友，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18801.99, "timestamp": "05:13:21", "text": "正确的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18803.43, "timestamp": "05:13:23", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18806.23, "timestamp": "05:13:26", "text": "呃，顺便说一下，呃，感谢 Sam 制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18809.67, "timestamp": "05:13:29", "text": "朋友们，呃，你们喜欢允许人们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18811.99, "timestamp": "05:13:31", "text": "就像你世界里的形式，就像关于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18814.31, "timestamp": "05:13:34", "text": "任何事物？我不在乎。给我们打电话或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18817.03, "timestamp": "05:13:37", "text": "随便吧，你知道，你喜欢怎样？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 18820.454, "timestamp": "05:13:40", "author": "@joqnix", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1rNe-FcvCKbSXpzuK86tx4EpeshYhox1KGRLnP8jvk1YWjbcndAtJwbDs74VZeGf462RnXuCJPE=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Today's Guest - WillowMeow | https://x.com/meow_willow | https://www.youtube.com/@WillowMeow/"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18822.15, "timestamp": "05:13:42", "text": "人们喜欢你那里的形式吗？呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18824.23, "timestamp": "05:13:44", "text": "我不喜欢收到邀请函之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18828.07, "timestamp": "05:13:48", "text": "就像加入请求一样，我就是不喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18831.75, "timestamp": "05:1